{"chunk_id": "d6ef8b13-28f0-4160-8738-0a0d5c2e4b24", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "# MySQL 索引和 MVCC\n\nMySQL 面试里，索引和事务几乎是必问。回答这类问题时，不要只背概念，要能把“为什么用 B+ 树”“索引什么时候失效”“MVCC 怎么支持快照读”串起来。\n\n![mysql-bplus-tree](./assets/mysql-bplus-tree.png)\n\n![mysql-mvcc-readview](./assets/mysql-mvcc-readview.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 206}
{"chunk_id": "7032b923-6b3d-4508-842b-e2692497b2bc", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "MySQL 面试里，索引和事务几乎是必问。回答这类问题时，不要只背概念，要能把“为什么用 B+ 树”“索引什么时候失效”“MVCC 怎么支持快照读”串起来。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "d6ef8b13-28f0-4160-8738-0a0d5c2e4b24", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC", "metadata": {"block_id": "7170684c-39cc-4398-84cb-664659a0a310"}, "char_len": 78}
{"chunk_id": "2b1a2c98-dd8c-4b21-a1a6-55f3bc2ffec5", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "![mysql-bplus-tree](./assets/mysql-bplus-tree.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "d6ef8b13-28f0-4160-8738-0a0d5c2e4b24", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "image_ocr", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC", "metadata": {"block_id": "82e3332b-7b4b-4ea3-b125-8401c54380dc"}, "char_len": 50}
{"chunk_id": "b7529a60-6ea4-4d24-a77e-e12ac94f866c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "![mysql-mvcc-readview](./assets/mysql-mvcc-readview.png)", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "d6ef8b13-28f0-4160-8738-0a0d5c2e4b24", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "image_ocr", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC", "metadata": {"block_id": "4969a4a3-1c5c-464e-b980-874adee658a8"}, "char_len": 56}
{"chunk_id": "7153e95b-01ba-4e63-888b-e302250f178a", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "## 一、为什么 InnoDB 常用 B+ 树索引\n\nB+ 树适合数据库索引，核心原因是它的高度低、范围查询友好、叶子节点有序链表连接。数据库通常按页读取数据，B+ 树一个节点可以存很多 key，因此树高通常只有 3 到 4 层，查询时磁盘 IO 次数较少。\n\n和二叉树相比，B+ 树更矮；和哈希索引相比，B+ 树支持范围查询和排序。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 一、为什么 InnoDB 常用 B+ 树索引", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 167}
{"chunk_id": "0b610e78-10a8-4b7d-840c-23dbe05e4900", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "B+ 树适合数据库索引，核心原因是它的高度低、范围查询友好、叶子节点有序链表连接。数据库通常按页读取数据，B+ 树一个节点可以存很多 key，因此树高通常只有 3 到 4 层，查询时磁盘 IO 次数较少。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7153e95b-01ba-4e63-888b-e302250f178a", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 一、为什么 InnoDB 常用 B+ 树索引", "metadata": {"block_id": "cd32115c-30b2-4905-b692-b00d358395df"}, "char_len": 102}
{"chunk_id": "985ae136-4129-44d7-a30f-9f9fe6b86e10", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "和二叉树相比，B+ 树更矮；和哈希索引相比，B+ 树支持范围查询和排序。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7153e95b-01ba-4e63-888b-e302250f178a", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 一、为什么 InnoDB 常用 B+ 树索引", "metadata": {"block_id": "8dc5ef97-c421-4868-84e2-eedd4e995dcd"}, "char_len": 36}
{"chunk_id": "ee3f08a8-26d3-4bd9-a355-08b5deb2767c", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "## 二、聚簇索引和二级索引\n\nInnoDB 的主键索引是聚簇索引，叶子节点存放完整行数据。二级索引的叶子节点存放主键值，所以使用二级索引查到主键后，可能需要回表查询完整数据。\n\n覆盖索引可以避免回表。例如：\n\n```sql\nSELECT id, name FROM user WHERE age = 18;\n```\n\n如果有联合索引 `(age, id, name)`，查询需要的字段都在索引里，就可能走覆盖索引。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 二、聚簇索引和二级索引", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 5}, "char_len": 208}
{"chunk_id": "65a15734-9446-4366-90d6-b3259d581187", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "InnoDB 的主键索引是聚簇索引，叶子节点存放完整行数据。二级索引的叶子节点存放主键值，所以使用二级索引查到主键后，可能需要回表查询完整数据。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "ee3f08a8-26d3-4bd9-a355-08b5deb2767c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 二、聚簇索引和二级索引", "metadata": {"block_id": "55666630-adc0-4d8b-b693-f629133677a7"}, "char_len": 72}
{"chunk_id": "43687a90-3377-4d61-9f97-da26cdd915f2", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "覆盖索引可以避免回表。例如：", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "ee3f08a8-26d3-4bd9-a355-08b5deb2767c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 二、聚簇索引和二级索引", "metadata": {"block_id": "81ddcf93-f761-4afc-ad6a-d9ff392e7954"}, "char_len": 14}
{"chunk_id": "d02e0faf-cd54-42ce-8dbe-9bbf72aa9516", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "```sql\nSELECT id, name FROM user WHERE age = 18;\n```", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "ee3f08a8-26d3-4bd9-a355-08b5deb2767c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "code", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 二、聚簇索引和二级索引", "metadata": {"block_id": "415db4e5-c3f3-4b6a-a8ad-1de3a24872c1"}, "char_len": 52}
{"chunk_id": "b4d692fe-d1aa-4b6d-9981-4249bf451783", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "如果有联合索引 `(age, id, name)`，查询需要的字段都在索引里，就可能走覆盖索引。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "ee3f08a8-26d3-4bd9-a355-08b5deb2767c", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 二、聚簇索引和二级索引", "metadata": {"block_id": "46b03f93-1916-4066-9ec1-11d20d05d7d0"}, "char_len": 48}
{"chunk_id": "639331b4-af40-47b0-8d69-305289a41622", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "## 三、索引失效场景\n\n常见索引失效包括：\n- 对索引列使用函数；\n- 隐式类型转换；\n- like 以 `%` 开头；\n- 联合索引不满足最左前缀；\n- or 条件中有部分字段没有索引；\n- 统计信息判断全表扫描更便宜。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 三、索引失效场景", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 112}
{"chunk_id": "f8f56e8e-5771-4df8-8fec-bf9ec93de52e", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "常见索引失效包括：\n- 对索引列使用函数；\n- 隐式类型转换；\n- like 以 `%` 开头；\n- 联合索引不满足最左前缀；\n- or 条件中有部分字段没有索引；\n- 统计信息判断全表扫描更便宜。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "639331b4-af40-47b0-8d69-305289a41622", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 三、索引失效场景", "metadata": {"block_id": "8eb9680e-6bf4-414a-94e0-8b1e12b05906"}, "char_len": 99}
{"chunk_id": "9aa5e74b-658c-4f9f-b106-6d0470011c38", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "## 四、MVCC 是什么\n\nMVCC 是多版本并发控制。InnoDB 通过隐藏字段、undo log 版本链、ReadView 实现快照读。每行记录有事务 id 和回滚指针，回滚指针指向 undo log 中的旧版本。\n\nReadView 里通常包含当前活跃事务列表、最小活跃事务 id、下一个事务 id 等信息。通过这些信息，MySQL 判断某个版本对当前事务是否可见。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 四、MVCC 是什么", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 3}, "char_len": 187}
{"chunk_id": "be49bc26-ed8f-452f-929e-90dadcfd42f2", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "MVCC 是多版本并发控制。InnoDB 通过隐藏字段、undo log 版本链、ReadView 实现快照读。每行记录有事务 id 和回滚指针，回滚指针指向 undo log 中的旧版本。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "9aa5e74b-658c-4f9f-b106-6d0470011c38", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 四、MVCC 是什么", "metadata": {"block_id": "24b39506-6e17-44ad-a05d-db3dc850cd47"}, "char_len": 95}
{"chunk_id": "622197e9-febd-4b9c-a846-95a4c6d0aae8", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "ReadView 里通常包含当前活跃事务列表、最小活跃事务 id、下一个事务 id 等信息。通过这些信息，MySQL 判断某个版本对当前事务是否可见。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "9aa5e74b-658c-4f9f-b106-6d0470011c38", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 四、MVCC 是什么", "metadata": {"block_id": "84f74e74-ee13-481f-bca9-f3a3177f17aa"}, "char_len": 75}
{"chunk_id": "05a59e8e-4254-4dcb-af01-98865203ec9a", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "## 五、RR 如何解决幻读\n\nInnoDB 在可重复读隔离级别下，普通快照读通过 MVCC 保证一致性；当前读则通过 next-key lock，也就是记录锁加间隙锁，避免范围内插入新记录，从而减少幻读问题。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 五、RR 如何解决幻读", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 105}
{"chunk_id": "1b602634-31f3-4efb-8805-0169bac2f12a", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "InnoDB 在可重复读隔离级别下，普通快照读通过 MVCC 保证一致性；当前读则通过 next-key lock，也就是记录锁加间隙锁，避免范围内插入新记录，从而减少幻读问题。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 0, "parent_id": "05a59e8e-4254-4dcb-af01-98865203ec9a", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 五、RR 如何解决幻读", "metadata": {"block_id": "44713309-c952-4040-996d-53fa8b012e66"}, "char_len": 89}
{"chunk_id": "7ed72068-7748-4f84-80d7-dcea187c1013", "doc_id": "xiaolin_002_mysql_index_mvcc", "text": "## 公众号引流\n\n关注小林 coding，回复「MySQL」领取索引和事务图解。  \n推荐阅读：图解 MySQL 日志、图解 Buffer Pool、图解 SQL 优化。  \n版权声明：本文仅用于学习交流。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "xiaolin_blog", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "MySQL 索引和 MVCC > 公众号引流", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 104}
